        "label": "Selected cluster",
        "description": "Written by the KSG panel alongside selected_pod on pod/controller click \u2014 the resolved cluster name. custom + multi + allowCustomValue (multi is normally unused since a click resolves to a single cluster; kept for shape consistency with selected_pod). Consume from a sibling log panel, e.g. ${cluster_sel:lucene}. $__empty means unresolved/nothing selected.",
        "type": "custom",
